C1 (G1 group only): 1 \u00b5F/6.3 V\\\"). The 4.7uF/25V value does not match that.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(comp (ref \\\"C1\\\")\\n      (value \\\"4.7uF/25V\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"| C1 (G1 group only): 1 \u00b5F/6.3 V | C2 = 1 \u00b5F/6.3 V | Matches G1-specific value |\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The charge-pump/boost timing and ripple behaviour of the e-paper driver will differ from the PDI reference circuit. This may affect panel drive voltages and charge-pump performance.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The EPD interface, power-path, FAN53610 and SD/keyboard connections match the specification. The two deviations I could support are a floating capacitor C10 with an inductor footprint, and a C1 value that differs from the spec's G1 value.\"\n}",
